  m_Name: Upgrade_MachineYield
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: VoxelEngine::VoxelEngine.Items.FurnaceUpgradeItem
  itemId: upgrade_machine_yield
  displayName: Machine Yield Module
  description: A universal machine module. Fits any machine whose upgrade slots finish
    recipe batches - the Crusher, Assembler, Electric Furnace, Metallurgical Foundry,
    Ore Washer, Oil Refinery, Chemical Plant, Distillation Plant and Catalytic Cracker.
    Every finished batch has a 12% chance per module of yielding one extra unit of
    the recipe's main product. Machines that grow or press on their own cycle (the
    Automatic Tree Farm and the Biomass Press) accept speed and efficiency modules
    only, and refuse this one at the slot.
